msgid ""
"快速开始\n"
"---------------------------------\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Quick start\n"
"---------------------------------\n"
""

msgid ""
"本文面向 Ascend NPU 环境，提供基于 GSM8K 和 Qwen3-0.6B 的最小化 GRPO 训练验证流程，涵盖四种训推后端组合，帮助用户快速上手。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"This article targets the Ascend NPU environment and provides a minimal GRPO training validation process based on GSM8K and Qwen3-0.6B. It covers four training and inference backend combinations to help you get started quickly.\n"
""

msgid ""
"验证范围：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Verification scope:\n"
""

msgid ""
"- 环境入口：verl 入口是否可用；\n"
"- 数据读取：GSM8K数据集是否正确解析；\n"
"- 组件初始化：actor、rollout、reference worker 是否能初始化；\n"
"- 模型推理：vLLM-Ascend/sglang rollout 是否能生成；\n"
"- 端到端链路：训练流程是否能完成首个 step。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"- Environment entry: whether the verl entry point is available;\n"
"- Data reading: whether the GSM8K dataset is correctly parsed;\n"
"- Component initialization: whether the actor, rollout, and reference workers can be initialized;\n"
"- Model inference: whether the vLLM-Ascend/sglang rollout can generate;\n"
"- End-to-end pipeline: whether the training process can complete the first step.\n"
""

msgid ""
"配置提示：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Configuration tips:\n"
""

msgid ""
"- 默认配置：示例脚本均使用 Qwen3-0.6B 模型和 GSM8K 数据集。\n"
"- 硬件适配：由于 A3 每卡含 2 Die，运行示例需将 ``n_gpus_per_node`` 参数设置为16（A2 每卡含 1 die）\n"
""
msgstr ""
"- Default configuration: All sample scripts use the Qwen3-0.6B model and the GSM8K dataset.\n"
"- Hardware adaptation: Because each A3 card contains 2 dies, running the samples requires setting the ``n_gpus_per_node`` parameter to 16 (each A2 card contains 1 die).\n"
""

msgid ""
"环境准备\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Environment Preparation\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""

msgid ""
"运行本文脚本前，请确认已完成 verl Ascend 环境安装。环境安装详见 `昇腾安装指南 <./install_guidance.rst>`_ 。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Before running the scripts in this guide, ensure that you have installed the verl Ascend environment. For installation details, refer to the `Ascend Installation Guide <./install_guidance.rst>`_.\n"
""

msgid ""
"权重准备\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Preparing weights\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""

msgid ""
"1. 请自行从Hugging Face上下载 Qwen3-0.6B 模型权重。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"1. Download the Qwen3-0.6B model weights from Hugging Face yourself.\n"
""

msgid ""
"2. 脚本中的默认读取权重路径为 ``~/models/Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B``，建议将权重放在该路径下。若路径不同请修改脚本中的MODEL_PATH指向本地路径。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"2. The default path for loading weights in the script is ``~/models/Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B``. We recommend placing the weights in this path. If you use a different path, modify MODEL_PATH in the script to point to your local path.\n"
""

msgid ""
"数据准备\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Data Preparation\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""

msgid ""
"1. 请自行从Hugging Face上下载 GSM8K 原始数据集。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"1. Download the original GSM8K dataset from Hugging Face.\n"
""

msgid ""
"2. 执行以下命令（请根据实际数据集路径调整命令）\n"
""
msgstr ""
"2. Run the following command (adjust the command based on your actual dataset path)\n"
""

msgid ""
"   生成如下文件：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"   Generate the following files:\n"
""

msgid ""
"运行方式\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""
msgstr ""
"How to run\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""

msgid ""
"1. 进入项目目录： ``cd /your/path/verl``。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"1. Enter the project directory: ``cd /your/path/verl``.\n"
""

msgid ""
"2. 使能CANN环境：执行以下命令。（若您自定义了 CANN 的路径，请根据实际路径调整命令。）\n"
""
msgstr ""
"2. Enable the CANN environment: Run the following command. (If you customized the CANN path, adjust the command based on the actual path.)\n"
""

msgid ""
"3. 运行脚本：当前提供四种常用训推后端组合，请参考以下表格选择对应脚本：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"3. Run the script: Currently, four common training and inference backend combinations are provided. Refer to the following table to select the corresponding script:\n"
""

msgid ""
"   * - 组合\n"
"     - 训练后端\n"
"     - rollout 后端\n"
"     - 运行方式\n"
"   * - vLLM + FSDP2\n"
"     - FSDP2\n"
"     - vLLM-Ascend\n"
"     - bash tests/special_npu/quick_start/run_qwen3_0_6b_fsdp2_vllm_ascend.sh\n"
"   * - vLLM + Megatron\n"
"     - Megatron\n"
"     - vLLM-Ascend\n"
"     - bash tests/special_npu/quick_start/run_qwen3_0_6b_megatron_vllm_ascend.sh\n"
"   * - SGLang + FSDP2\n"
"     - FSDP2\n"
"     - SGLang\n"
"     - bash tests/special_npu/quick_start/run_qwen3_0_6b_fsdp2_sglang_ascend.sh\n"
"   * - SGLang + Megatron\n"
"     - Megatron\n"
"     - SGLang\n"
"     - bash tests/special_npu/quick_start/run_qwen3_0_6b_megatron_sglang_ascend.sh\n"
""
msgstr ""
"   * - Combination\n"
"     - Training backend\n"
"     - Rollout backend\n"
"     - Running method\n"
"   * - vLLM + FSDP2\n"
"     - FSDP2\n"
"     - vLLM-Ascend\n"
"     - bash tests/special_npu/quick_start/run_qwen3_0_6b_fsdp2_vllm_ascend.sh\n"
"   * - vLLM + Megatron\n"
"     - Megatron\n"
"     - vLLM-Ascend\n"
"     - bash tests/special_npu/quick_start/run_qwen3_0_6b_megatron_vllm_ascend.sh\n"
"   * - SGLang + FSDP2\n"
"     - FSDP2\n"
"     - SGLang\n"
"     - bash tests/special_npu/quick_start/run_qwen3_0_6b_fsdp2_sglang_ascend.sh\n"
"   * - SGLang + Megatron\n"
"     - Megatron\n"
"     - SGLang\n"
"     - bash tests/special_npu/quick_start/run_qwen3_0_6b_megatron_sglang_ascend.sh\n"
""

msgid ""
"脚本内具体参数说明详见 `训练配置参数与指标说明 <../dev_guide/model_dev/parameter_and_metrics.md>`_。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"For detailed parameter descriptions in the script, refer to `Training Configuration Parameters and Metrics Description <../dev_guide/model_dev/parameter_and_metrics.md>`_.\n"
""

msgid ""
"多节点任务拉起详见 `多机任务拉起操作指南 <../model_support/examples/multi-machine_task_startup_practice.rst>`_。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"For details on multi-node task startup, see `Multi-Machine Task Startup Practice Guide <../model_support/examples/multi-machine_task_startup_practice.rst>`_.\n"
""

msgid ""
"附录\n"
"-------------------------------------------\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Appendix\n"
"-------------------------------------------\n"
""

msgid ""
"SGLang 后端使能说明\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Enabling the SGLang backend\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""

msgid ""
"当前 verl 已解析推理常见参数，详见 `async_sglang_server.py <../../../../verl/workers/rollout/sglang_rollout/async_sglang_server.py>`_ 中 ``ServerArgs`` 初始化传参。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Currently, verl has parsed common inference parameters. For details, see the ``ServerArgs`` initialization parameters in `async_sglang_server.py <../../../../verl/workers/rollout/sglang_rollout/async_sglang_server.py>`_.\n"
""

msgid ""
"其他 `SGLang 参数 <https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/v0.5.10/docs/advanced_features/server_arguments.md>`_ 均可通过 ``engine_kwargs`` 进行参数传递。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"You can pass other `SGLang parameters <https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/v0.5.10/docs/advanced_features/server_arguments.md>`_ using ``engine_kwargs``.\n"
""

msgid ""
"vLLM 后端脚本转换为 SGLang\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Convert the vLLM backend script to SGLang\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""

msgid ""
"如需自行将 vLLM 后端推理脚本转换为 SGLang，需要添加或修改以下参数。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"To convert the vLLM backend inference script to SGLang yourself, you need to add or modify the following parameters.\n"
""

msgid ""
"   # 必须\n"
"   actor_rollout_ref.rollout.name=sglang \\\n"
"   +actor_rollout_ref.rollout.engine_kwargs.sglang.attention_backend=\"ascend\" \\\n"
""
msgstr ""
"   # Required\n"
"   actor_rollout_ref.rollout.name=sglang \\\n"
"   +actor_rollout_ref.rollout.engine_kwargs.sglang.attention_backend=\"ascend\" \\\n"
""

msgid ""
"   # 可选\n"
"   # 使能推理 EP，详细使用方法见：\n"
"   # https://github.com/sgl-project/sgl-kernel-npu/blob/main/python/deep_ep/README.md\n"
"   ++actor_rollout_ref.rollout.engine_kwargs.sglang.deepep_mode=\"auto\" \\\n"
"   ++actor_rollout_ref.rollout.engine_kwargs.sglang.moe_a2a_backend=\"deepep\" \\\n"
""
msgstr ""
"   # Optional\n"
"   # Enable inference EP. For details, see:\n"
"   # https://github.com/sgl-project/sgl-kernel-npu/blob/main/python/deep_ep/README.md\n"
"   ++actor_rollout_ref.rollout.engine_kwargs.sglang.deepep_mode=\"auto\" \\\n"
"   ++actor_rollout_ref.rollout.engine_kwargs.sglang.moe_a2a_backend=\"deepep\" \\\n"
""

msgid ""
"   # MoE 模型多 DP 时必须设置为 True（默认为False）\n"
"   +actor_rollout_ref.rollout.engine_kwargs.sglang.enable_dp_attention=False \\   "
msgstr ""
"   # Must be set to True for MoE models with multiple DP (default is False)\n"
"   +actor_rollout_ref.rollout.engine_kwargs.sglang.enable_dp_attention=False \\"

msgid ""
"- 2026/06/30：新增覆盖四种常用训推后端组合，便于用户在 quickstart 阶段快速选择合适的启动脚本。\n"
"- 2026/05/13：将 quick start 和 install guidance 分开。\n"
"- 2025/12/11：verl场景目前支持自动识别 NPU 设备类型，GPU 脚本在昇腾上运行，原则上不再需要显式设置 ``trainer.device=npu`` 参数，新增特性通过设置 ``trainer.device`` 仍可优先使用，逐步适配自动识别能力。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"- 2026/06/30: Added coverage for four common training and inference backend combinations to help you quickly select the appropriate startup script during the quickstart phase.\n"
"- 2026/05/13: Separated the quick start and install guidance.\n"
"- 2025/12/11: verl currently supports automatic identification of NPU device types. When you run GPU scripts on Ascend, in principle, you no longer need to explicitly set the ``trainer.device=npu`` parameter. You can still prioritize new features by setting ``trainer.device``, gradually adapting to the automatic identification capability.\n"
""
